<title>JAPAN: Toyota to up stake in Hino Motors.</title>
<headline>Toyota to up stake in Hino Motors.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp said on Monday that it had decided to raise its stake in Hino Motors Ltd to 16.4 percent from 11.1 percent.</p>
<p>The nation's leading car manufacturer said in a statement that it would buy an additional 19.3 million shares in Hino, a truck manufacturer, in an attempt to achieve closer cooperation in the business of small trucks.</p>
</text>
